  "question": {
    "html": "<p>The mass of a main sequence star is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"18M_{\\odot}\"></span> and its stellar parallax is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.05\\: \\textup{arc-second}\"></span>.</p>\n<p>What is one of the stages during the life cycle of this star and what is the best estimate for the distance of the star from Earth?</p>\n\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>One of the stages during life cycle of the star</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Distance of the star from Earth</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"A\">\n<td>\n<p><strong>A.</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>Supernova</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"6 \\times 10^{14}\\: \\textup{km}\"></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"B\">\n<td>\n<p><strong>B.</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>Supernova</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2 \\times 10^{14}\\: \\textup{km}\"></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"C\">\n<td>\n<p><strong>C.</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>Planetary nebula</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"6 \\times 10^{14}\\: \\textup{km}\"></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"D\">\n<td>\n<p><strong>D.</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>Planetary nebula</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2 \\times 10^{14}\\: \\textup{km}\"></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
